```typescript
  | { nonce: string; token: string; type: 'reauth-response' }
```

Add to `WireTerminalServerMessage` (line 146):

```typescript
  | { expiresAt: number; nonce: string; type: 'reauth-challenge' }
  | { reason: 'expired' | 'invalid' | 'timeout'; type: 'reauth-rejected' }
```

